  governs 2025-03-01..2025-12-31
  known 2025-03-01
  covers shared
  note "each row is known on its own date (Entries); row 3 is Mirela's part of her aunt's estate (S1-D1)"
  bank[r1] = (on: 2025-03-10, kind: pays, leg cash from world to shared amount 3150.00 DUK) known 2025-03-10 "S1-R1 row 1: PAY OSTRA LOGISTIKA M.DANEK"
  bank[r2] = (on: 2025-03-10, kind: pays, leg cash from world to shared amount 2870.00 DUK) known 2025-03-10 "S1-R1 row 2: PAY VERNO TECH J.DANEK"
  bank[r3] = (on: 2025-03-14, kind: inheritances, leg cash from world to shared amount 28000.00 DUK, heir: mirela) known 2025-03-14 "S1-R1 row 3: NOTARY K.BRELL ESTATE A.VORN M.DANEK"
  bank[r4] = (on: 2025-03-20, kind: payments, leg cash from shared to world amount 3950.00 DUK, for_one: none) known 2025-03-20 "S1-R1 row 4: HOUSEHOLD ORDER RENT BILLS SHOPPING"
  bank[r5] = (on: 2025-03-31, kind: interests, leg cash from world to shared amount 18.42 DUK) known 2025-03-31 "S1-R1 row 5: INTEREST"
